# ── Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
**/secrets/

# ── NEVER commit a real fleet instance ──────────────────────────────────
# This repo ships the generic KIT + a fictional example only.
# Your real control plane, charters, and memory are private data — keep them
# in ~/agents and ~/.claude, never copied in here. These guard against accident:
/agents/
/memory/
**/_control/*.local.md
# (the fictional example/ tree is intentionally tracked — it contains no real data)

# ── OS / editor cruft ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Untitled.base
*.pre-bundle-*
_migration_report.json
.obsidian/
